    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Learn more about Coast Cannabis Co. products <em>(Gummies, Chocolates and Vaporizers)</em> and enjoy some of their non-infused, delicious gummies and/or chocolates!</strong></p><p>Coast Cannabis Co. is on a mission to make feeling good feel good because, for us, cannabis is a wellness tool that should help you be your best self. But unfortunately, all the additives and junk that often come with it can make it anything but healthy. At Coast Cannabis Co., we craft quality products to give our customers the cannabis we wanted to see in the world.</p><p>They are making sure everything that goes into their products is something they’d be proud to put into their bodies. That means using only high-quality, natural, artisanal ingredients, with no artificial dyes or colorings. But beyond that, we’re also sourcing conscientiously: Choosing fair trade, ethically grown ingredients because they’re better for you and the world around you.</p><p><a href=\"/brands/coast-cannabis-co/\"><strong>Click here to shop Coast Cannabis Co. products!</strong></a></p>"
    },
